  "notes": [
    "v2-15-reevaluate-rug: the first evidence run crashed on a transient Studionet RPC failure (gateway returned an HTML error page for eth_getTransactionByHash) AFTER the transaction finalized on-chain. The finalized receipt and latest-final readback were fetched live and recorded in the checkpoint before the run resumed at v2-16; no transaction was re-sent. Its observations file records only the FINALIZED observation at recovery time.",
    "Case (a) withdraw EOA deltas: the resumed run re-measured balances around the already-recorded v2-06/v2-08 withdraws and overwrote both deltas with 0. Corrected from the on-chain ledger deltas in the paired readbacks: total_withdrawn_units 0 -> 27044 (creator, 27.044 GEN) and 27044 -> 96484 (buyer, 69.44 GEN), matching the first run EOA-delta log lines.",
    "Expected-failure error strings: the runner decoded the leader-receipt result object as \"[object Object]\". The receipts themselves carry contract_error exit_code 1 for both v2-03 (stranger evaluate) and v2-14 (execute while challenged); the strings were corrected to that. The expected-failure semantics are proven by state: after v2-03 the curve still awaited creator evaluation, and after v2-14 the rug curve stayed VERDICT_PENDING."
  ]
